\subtree{
\title{3.5 Calls, hit rates, declarations without reduction}

\p{Whole cedar (other corpora: \code{\verb~|tables/dyn-summary.md~} D3): 42.0 M infer calls (13.7 M misses), 94.6 M eval calls (50.3 M misses), 36.2 M \code{\verb~|def_eq~} calls (5.66 M not answered at once), 2.85 M \code{\verb~|whnf~} calls (1.09 M misses), 2.77 M delta, 693 k rule firings, 857 k iota, 1.06 M projections, 117 k Nat operations; 34.8 M values made for 7.5 M inferred applications (4.6 each, all phases included). Hit rates (cedar; the other library corpora are within 5 points): infer memo 67\%, eval memo 47\%, \code{\verb~|def_eq~} answered by pointer identity or the equality cache 84\% (rpylean: 85.5\% identity + 5.4\% union-find; gruszka counts only non-identical pairs and hits its cache on 37\%), whnf memo 62\%, unfold memo 14\%, Pi-instantiation memo 60\%.}

